<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ-E GROUP NET RISES IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ-E GROUP NET RISES IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary group results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL			    1997     1996</p>
<p> Group net profit	     0.33 vs   0.04</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 0.57 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Group operating profit     0.28 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Group sales		   15.50 vs   4.18</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL		  1997     1996</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1.68 vs   0.65</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 2.63 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Group operating profit     1.78 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Group sales		   51.21 vs  11.17</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
